35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The data is clear. Last year’s separation caused the disconnect, but shared houses trap us. We need a town with public spaces.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, a single bill divides evenly, unlike last year’s uneven rooms. That settles the money question for me.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I am glad we are moving together. But the island house has only one bathroom, and the water runs cold. I worry about washing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ferry takes two full days. The train is ninety minutes. I cannot lose another week to waiting.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The island house is 5,400 yen a head a night, but food is extra. I need the total before we commit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, the island’s single bathroom is a problem. @Midori, the extra food costs are worrying. We need a place with clear, all-in pricing and public spaces.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the all-in rate means I pay the same as the biggest eater. I would rather settle meals as we order them, so no one is shortchanged.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mizuki, I am glad we are moving together. But the island house has only one bathroom, and the water runs cold. I worry about washing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, I hear you. But the train is ninety minutes, not two days. I need to know if the inn’s fixed mealtimes will feel like a cage.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, I understand. But I need the total cost before we commit. The island’s extra food makes the bill unpredictable, which worries me.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, the inn’s fixed mealtimes might feel rigid, but moving together solves the isolation. I need to know if the town offers enough space for us to breathe.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, I worry about the fixed times too. But a single bill is fairer than last year’s uneven rooms.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, I am worried about the fixed times. I just want to know if I can wash and sleep well without rushing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, the baths open until midnight, so you can wash whenever you are ready. I just need the week to feel like ours, not a schedule.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, the baths are open late, which helps. But I still need the total cost. The island’s extra food makes the bill unpredictable, which worries me.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, the valley inn folds meals in, so the total is fixed. That solves your worry and keeps us together.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
