53,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, the ninety-minute train is acceptable. I just need the days to feel unhurried, not dictated by a rigid timetable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, that is wonderful. Knowing the total cost upfront brings me great peace. I am ready to choose the valley inn.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
